      "content": "Wait, a whole bottle of vitamin c?? that sounds like a lot lol. also u said the kidney thing isnt a big deal but my doctor was actually kinda worried about my creatinine levels being high. are u sure i don't need to call them before i take the macrobid? i don't want to mess up my kidneys more if the dosage is wrong.",
